Typography: clean and readable first. Needs to look good small (like favicon size) and large (website header). Sans-serif probably makes more sense for our industry, but honestly if something with more character fits the Iowa vibe, we're open to it.

Deliverables we need:

1. Primary logo in full color
2. Black/white version
3. Reversed version for dark backgrounds
4. Icon-only version for social media profiles
5. All vector files (AI, EPS, SVG)
6. PNG exports at 300dpi in 512x512, 1024x1024, 2000x2000

Technical stuff:

File formats: AI, EPS, SVG, PDF, PNG
Resolution: minimum 300dpi for raster formats
Safe zone: 10% padding around elements
Color mode: CMYK for print, RGB for digital

Process: we'll want to see 3 initial concepts before deciding on direction. Then up to 2 rounds of revisions on the chosen one.

Contact me at nate@marketingmainstreet.co if you're interested. Send along examples of similar work you've done - marketing agencies or local businesses preferred.

